*** Add File:ops/agents/README_policy_override.md
+Multi-party override flow (high level)
+
+1) When an action is blocked by OPA as "destructive", the agent should place the action into the human review queue:
+   POST /enqueue to review service with payload and reason.
+2) Approvers retrieve the item and produce signed approval blobs (cosign sign-blob or cosign sign via KMS).
+3) Approvals are submitted to review service /approve endpoint as hex-encoded blobs.
+4) The review service runs verify_approvals.py to validate signatures and, if >= REQUIRED_APPROVALS, marks the item approved.
+5) The agent re-submits the action to the jailed executor with approvals attached so OPA policy can accept it.
+
